            </note>
            <note corresp="#d125-f2" n="2" xml:id="d125-f2-content">
                <p>Transmitted in telegram 2475, October 1, <ref target="#pg275">p. 275</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d125-f3" n="3" xml:id="d125-f3-content">
                <p>The text of the British note, delivered to the Soviet Embassy in the United
                    Kingdom on October 10, was transmitted in telegram 4060, October 10, from
                    London, not printed. (862.01/10–1049)</p>
            </note>
